# BAT lobby desk. Flags read: badge_returned (Landry vouched), bat_badge item.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('badge_returned')
goto: Vouched

cond: HasItem('bat_badge')
goto: Badge

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Welcome to Bushido-ArmaTech. The lobby is for badge holders. How did you get through the door?
#
o_text: It was open.
o_id: recep_open
o_goto: Open
#
o_text: I'm here for Tanaka. Or Miller.
o_id: recep_board
o_goto: Board
#
o_text: Leaving.
o_id: recep_leave
o_goto: End

name: Open
npc: (She makes a note.) Maintenance will hear about it. Mind the cameras.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: open_back
o_goto: Default

name: Board
npc: Mr. Tanaka's office is upstairs right, Ms. Miller's is the lab downstairs right. Neither takes walk-ins. Both will talk to you anyway; they like an audience.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: board_back
o_goto: Default

name: Badge
npc: (Her eyes go to the badge, then to your face.) That is Chief Landry's badge. He is taller.
+ I am not paid enough to stop you. Go on through.
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: recep_badge_leave
o_goto: End

name: Vouched
npc: Chief Landry called ahead. You are on the list, which is a short list. Welcome to Bushido-ArmaTech.
#
o_text: Where do I find the board?
o_id: recep_vouched_board
o_goto: Board
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: recep_vouched_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: Have a strong day.
effect: EndConversation
